---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Explica'ns el teu cas — Consulta per a particulars"
description: "Formulari guiat per a particulars i comunitats. Primera consulta sense cost. T'orientem sobre si necessites un dictamen pericial."
lang: ca
eleventyNavigation:
  key: ContacteParticular
  notshow: true
translations:
  - lang: es
    permalink: /contacto/particular/
  - lang: en
    permalink: /en/contact/particular/
permalink: "/ca/contacte/particular/"
breadcrumb_parent:
  label: "Contacte"
  url: "/contacte/"
---
{% set ui = ca %}
{% set heroTitle = "Explica'ns<br>el teu cas" %}
{% include "partials/page-hero.njk" %}

<div style="max-width: var(--container-wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px var(--gutter) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);"><span style="font-size: var(--fs-small, 0.8rem); color: var(--text-muted);">És despatx o asseguradora? </span><a href="/ca/contacte/professional/" style="font-size: var(--fs-small, 0.8rem); color: var(--text-accent); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;" onmouseenter="this.style.borderBottomColor='var(--accent)'" onmouseleave="this.style.borderBottomColor='transparent'">Sol·licitar col·laboració tècnica →</a></div>

<section style="max-width: var(--container-wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--section-y) var(--gutter);">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: clamp(28px,4vw,64px); align-items: start;" class="site-two">

<div>
<div style="border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); background: var(--surface-card); overflow: hidden;">
<div style="padding: 18px 24px 0;">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;">
<span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-mono-label); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);">Explica'ns el teu cas</span>
<span id="intake-p-counter" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--text-faint);">§ 01 / 04</span>
</div>
<div style="height: 2px; background: var(--stone-250, #d6d3cd); margin-top: 14px; border-radius: 1px; overflow: hidden;">
<div id="intake-p-bar" style="height: 100%; width: 25%; background: var(--accent); transition: width 0.4s ease;"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="intake-p-body" style="padding: 28px 24px 8px; min-height: 280px;"></div>
<div id="intake-p-footer" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 24px 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); margin-top: 8px;">
<button id="intake-p-back" type="button" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted); background: transparent; border: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 12px; visibility: hidden;">Enrere</button>
<span id="intake-p-hint" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-faint);">Selecciona una opció</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div>
<div style="position: sticky; top: 92px;">
<div style="border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); background: var(--surface-card); overflow: hidden;">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 12px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-mono-label); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label); text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);">Consulta per a particulars</div>
<div style="padding: 22px 22px 24px;">
<div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 1.6rem; color: var(--text-accent); margin-bottom: 4px;">Consulta sense cost</div>
<div style="margin-top: 14px;">
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;">01</span><span>T'orientem sobre si necessites un dictamen</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;">02</span><span>Pressupost tancat per escrit</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;">03</span><span>Resposta en 24 h laborables</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: 2px;">04</span><span>Ratificació en sala inclosa</span></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-top: 18px;">
<a href="tel:{{ metadata.contact.phoneNumber | replace(' ', '') }}" style="flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); background: var(--surface-raised); text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>{{ metadata.contact.phoneNumber | replace('+34 ', '') }}</a>
<a href="mailto:{{ metadata.company.email }}" style="flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--border-hairline); background: var(--surface-raised); text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-strong);">Email</a>
</div>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-faint);">Confidencial · Sense compromís</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<script>
(function(){
  'use strict';
  var STEPS = [
    { key: 'problema', eyebrow: '§ 01 · La teva situació', type: 'choice',
      question: 'Què està passant al teu immoble?',
      helper: 'Tria l\'opció més propera. Després podràs detallar-ho.',
      options: ['Humitats o filtracions', 'Esquerdes, fissures o moviments', 'Vicis ocults després de comprar', 'Reforma o obra mal executada', 'Altre problema constructiu'] },
    { key: 'immoble', eyebrow: '§ 02 · L\'immoble', type: 'choice',
      question: 'De quin tipus d\'immoble parlem?',
      options: ['Habitatge particular', 'Comunitat de propietaris', 'Local o nau', 'Edifici o obra pública'] },
    { key: 'antiguitat', eyebrow: '§ 03 · Des de quan', type: 'choice',
      question: 'Des de quan apareix el problema?',
      helper: 'Ens ajuda a valorar terminis de garantia i responsabilitat.',
      options: ['Menys de 6 mesos', 'Entre 6 mesos i 2 anys', 'Més de 2 anys', 'No ho sé amb certesa'] },
    { key: 'contacte', eyebrow: '§ 04 · Contacte', type: 'fields',
      question: 'Com et contactem?',
      helper: 'Primera consulta sense cost. Responem en 24 h laborables.',
      fields: [
        { name: 'nom', label: 'Nom i cognoms', placeholder: 'El teu nom', required: true },
        { name: 'poblacio', label: 'Població de l\'immoble', placeholder: 'Ex. Barcelona', required: true },
        { name: 'email', label: 'Correu electrònic', type: 'email', placeholder: 'nom@correu.com', required: true },
        { name: 'telefon', label: 'Telèfon', type: 'tel', placeholder: '+34 ___ ___ ___', required: true },
        { name: 'detall', label: 'Explica\'ns-ho en una línia', multiline: true, rows: 3, placeholder: 'El que creguis rellevant…', required: false }
      ] }
  ];
  var TOTAL = STEPS.length, current = 0, answers = {}, done = false;
  function pad(n){ return String(n).length < 2 ? '0'+n : String(n); }
  function render(){
    var body = document.getElementById('intake-p-body'), bar = document.getElementById('intake-p-bar'), counter = document.getElementById('intake-p-counter'), backBtn = document.getElementById('intake-p-back'), hint = document.getElementById('intake-p-hint'), footer = document.getElementById('intake-p-footer');
    if(!body) return; body.innerHTML = '';
    var pct = done ? 100 : Math.round(((current+1)/TOTAL)*100); bar.style.width = pct+'%'; counter.textContent = '§ '+pad(done?TOTAL:current+1)+' / '+pad(TOTAL); backBtn.style.visibility = current===0 ? 'hidden' : 'visible';
    if(done){ footer.style.display='none'; body.innerHTML='<div style="text-align:center;padding:14px 0 24px;"><div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(30,100,60,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:22px;font-weight:600;">✉</div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--fs-h2,1.75rem);font-weight:400;margin:20px 0 0;color:var(--text-strong);">Últim pas: envia l\'email</h3><p style="margin:12px auto 0;max-width:40ch;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.55;">S\'ha obert el teu programa de correu amb les dades del formulari. Prem «Enviar» perquè ens arribi la teva consulta. Et respondrem en 24 h laborables.</p></div>'; return; }
    var step = STEPS[current], html = '';
    if(step.eyebrow) html += '<div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:var(--fs-mono-label,0.6875rem);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label,0.14em);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-accent);margin-bottom:12px;">'+step.eyebrow+'</div>';
    html += '<h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--fs-h2,1.75rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;color:var(--text-strong);margin:0;">'+step.question+'</h3>';
    if(step.helper) html += '<p style="margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.55;">'+step.helper+'</p>';
    if(step.type==='choice'){ hint.textContent='Selecciona una opció'; html+='<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:22px;">'; step.options.forEach(function(opt,k){ var letter=String.fromCharCode(65+k); var sel=answers[step.key]===opt; html+='<button type="button" data-choice="'+k+'" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:14px 16px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;background:'+(sel?'var(--accent-tint)':'var(--surface-raised,#fff)')+';border:1.5px solid;border-color:'+(sel?'var(--accent)':'var(--border-hairline)')+';border-radius:var(--radius-sm);transition:background 0.15s ease,border-color 0.15s ease;"><span style="width:24px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:var(--radius-xs);border:1px solid;border-color:'+(sel?'var(--accent)':'var(--border-hairline)')+';background:'+(sel?'var(--accent)':'transparent')+';color:'+(sel?'var(--bone-100)':'var(--text-muted)')+';display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;">'+letter+'</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.975rem;color:var(--text-strong);">'+opt+'</span></button>'; }); html+='</div>'; }
    if(step.type==='fields'){ hint.textContent=''; hint.innerHTML='<button type="button" id="intake-p-submit" style="font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-on,#fff);background:var(--accent);border:1.5px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:10px 20px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;letter-spacing:0.005em;">Enviar sol·licitud</button>'; html+='<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;margin-top:22px;">'; step.fields.forEach(function(f){ var val=(answers[step.key]&&answers[step.key][f.name])||''; html+='<div><label for="ip-'+f.name+'" style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-strong);margin-bottom:6px;">'+f.label+(f.required?'':'<span style="color:var(--text-faint);font-weight:400;margin-left:6px;">(opcional)</span>')+'</label>'; if(f.multiline){ html+='<textarea id="ip-'+f.name+'" name="'+f.name+'" rows="'+(f.rows||3)+'" placeholder="'+(f.placeholder||'')+'" '+(f.required?'required':'')+' style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.95rem;padding:12px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--border-hairline);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--surface-raised,#fff);color:var(--text-strong);resize:vertical;outline:none;">'+val+'</textarea>'; } else { html+='<input id="ip-'+f.name+'" type="'+(f.type||'text')+'" name="'+f.name+'" placeholder="'+(f.placeholder||'')+'" value="'+val+'" '+(f.required?'required':'')+' style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.95rem;padding:12px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--border-hairline);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--surface-raised,#fff);color:var(--text-strong);outline:none;">'; } html+='</div>'; }); html+='</div>'; }
    body.innerHTML = html;
    body.querySelectorAll('[data-choice]').forEach(function(btn){ btn.addEventListener('click', function(){ answers[step.key]=step.options[parseInt(btn.getAttribute('data-choice'))]; setTimeout(function(){if(current<TOTAL-1){current++;render();}},240); render(); }); });
    body.querySelectorAll('input,textarea').forEach(function(inp){ inp.addEventListener('input',function(){if(!answers[step.key])answers[step.key]={};answers[step.key][inp.name]=inp.value;}); inp.addEventListener('focus',function(){inp.style.borderColor='var(--accent)';}); inp.addEventListener('blur',function(){inp.style.borderColor='var(--border-hairline)';}); });
    var sb=document.getElementById('intake-p-submit'); if(sb){sb.addEventListener('click',function(){ var cd=answers.contacte||{}; var valid=step.fields.every(function(f){if(!f.required)return true;var v=cd[f.name];return v&&v.trim().length>0;}); if(!valid){alert('Si us plau, omple els camps obligatoris.');return;} submitForm(); });}
  }
  function submitForm(){
    var cd=answers.contacte||{}; var payload={tipo_cliente:'particular',lang:'ca',nombre:cd.nom||'',email:cd.email||'',telefono:cd.telefon||'',ciudad:cd.poblacio||'',empresa:'',cargo:'',problema:answers.problema||'',inmueble:answers.immoble||'',importe:answers.antiguitat||'',procesal:'',detalle:cd.detall||'',origen:'Formulari Particular CA',timestamp:new Date().toISOString()};
    var bd=document.getElementById('intake-p-body');if(bd)bd.innerHTML='<div style="text-align:center;padding:40px 0;"><div style="width:36px;height:36px;border:3px solid var(--border-hairline);border-top-color:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;animation:spin 0.8s linear infinite;"></div><p style="margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.95rem;">Enviant…</p></div><style>@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}</style>';document.getElementById('intake-p-footer').style.display='none';
    var ctrl=new AbortController();var timer=setTimeout(function(){ctrl.abort();},10000);
    fetch('https://hook.eu2.make.com/76yaogaunrc9cqdtf26ldcoxb3fpndma',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload),signal:ctrl.signal}).then(function(r){clearTimeout(timer);if(!r.ok)throw new Error('HTTP '+r.status);done=true;render();setTimeout(function(){window.location.href='/ca/gracies/';},2500);}).catch(function(){
      clearTimeout(timer);
      var subject=encodeURIComponent('Consulta web — Particular');
      var bodyParts='No s\'ha pogut enviar el formulari. Dades:\n\nNom: '+(cd.nom||'')+'\nPoblació: '+(cd.poblacio||'')+'\nEmail: '+(cd.email||'')+'\nTelèfon: '+(cd.telefon||'')+'\nProblema: '+(answers.problema||'')+'\nImmoble: '+(answers.immoble||'')+'\nAntiguitat: '+(answers.antiguitat||'')+'\n\nDetall:\n'+(cd.detall||'');
      var mailto='mailto:info@perito.barcelona?subject='+subject+'&body='+encodeURIComponent(bodyParts);
      var body=document.getElementById('intake-p-body');
      if(body)body.innerHTML='<style>@keyframes errorSlideIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}@keyframes errorPulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.08)}}</style><div style="padding:20px 0;animation:errorSlideIn 0.4s ease-out;"><div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;"><div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(220,53,69,0.1);animation:errorPulse 1.5s ease-in-out 1;"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#dc3545" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg></div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:var(--fs-h2,1.75rem);font-weight:400;margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--text-strong);">No s\'ha pogut enviar</h3><p style="margin:8px auto 0;max-width:38ch;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.55;">Les teves dades estan guardades. Fes servir una d\'aquestes opcions:</p></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;"><a href="'+mailto+'" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);border:1.5px solid var(--accent);background:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-on,#fff)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg><span style="flex:1;"><span style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent-on,#fff);">Obrir email amb les teves dades</span><span style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.7rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin-top:2px;">info@perito.barcelona</span></span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.6)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg></a><a href="tel:+34614194985" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);border:1.5px solid var(--border-hairline);background:var(--surface-raised,#fff);text-decoration:none;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg><span style="flex:1;"><span style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-strong);">Trucar ara</span><span style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.7rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:2px;">614 194 985</span></span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-faint)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg></a></div><button type="button" onclick="location.reload()" style="display:block;width:100%;margin-top:16px;padding:10px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-muted);background:transparent;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">Reintentar enviament</button></div>';
    });
  }
  document.getElementById('intake-p-back').addEventListener('click',function(){if(current>0){current--;render();}});
  render();
})();
</script>

